</section><section class="wrap origin-section" data-star-anchor="origin"><div class="origin-art"><svg viewBox="0 0 340 340" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g stroke="#94abc3"><circle cx="170" cy="151" r="94" stroke-opacity=".18" stroke-width=".7"/><circle cx="170" cy="151" r="80" stroke-opacity=".22" stroke-dasharray="1 7" stroke-width=".7"/><ellipse cx="170" cy="151" rx="137" ry="54" transform="rotate(-32 170 151)" stroke-opacity=".5" stroke-width=".7"/><path d="M170 36V69M170 233V265M52 151H81M258 151H289" stroke-opacity=".3" stroke-width=".7"/></g><path d="M170 109C173 142 179 148 212 151C179 154 173 160 170 193C167 160 161 154 128 151C161 148 167 142 170 109Z" fill="#d6b881"/><circle cx="280" cy="76" r="2.5" fill="#d6b881"/><path d="M44 282C56 282 62 261 74 261S89 303 105 303S120 262 137 262S152 294 170 294S185 270 202 270S220 287 236 287S251 275 269 275S283 282 297 282" stroke="#d6b881" stroke-width=".8" stroke-opacity=".5"/><path d="M44 282H297" stroke="#d6b881" stroke-opacity=".15" stroke-width=".5"/></svg></div><div class="origin-copy"><p class="eyebrow">A NOTE ON OUR NAME</p><h2>A wonderful star.<br><em>A lasting curiosity.</em></h2><p class="origin-cn">星芒会变，求索不息。</p><p>Astr，遥远星空；Mira，真实的变星；Mirage，尚待抵达的想象。我们把这层诗意称作「幻梦星芒」。</p><p style="margin-top:13px">Mira 的亮度随时间变化，并留下绵长的紫外星尾。我们借它讲述一种研究态度：对未知保有想象，让探索留下可以继续生长的痕迹。</p><a class="source" href="https://apod.nasa.gov/apod/ap070817.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">名称灵感 · NASA / The Tail of a Wonderful Star ↗</a></div></section><section class="wrap"><div class="collaborate-block"><div><p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:18px">LET’S ASK THE NEXT QUESTION</p><h2>下一个值得研究的问题，<br>也许来自你。</h2><p>数据库与智能系统 · 科研合作 · 高校联合研究<br>从一个真实的问题，开始一次有意义的合作。</p></div><a href="/collaborate/" data-route="collaborate" class="button button-primary" >开启一次对话 <span class="arrow">↗</span></a></div></section>
